Common Type Disability
	documentation 'This type represents an impairment of body structure or function, a limitation 
	'in activities, or a restriction in participation, as ordered by severity of 
	'impairment.
    descriptor Disability
        documentation 'A disability category that describes a child's impairment.
        is part of identity
    string DisabilityDiagnosis
        documentation 'A description of the disability diagnosis.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 80
    integer OrderOfDisability
        documentation 'The order by severity of student's disabilities: 1- Primary, 2 -  Secondary, 3 - 
        'Tertiary, etc.
        is optional
	enumeration DisabilityDeterminationSourceType
		documentation 'The source that provided the disability determination.
		is optional

